-- Drakkin as a playable race, starting in Freeport (never Crescent Reach). The NMS release has no Drakkin
-- creation rows; every expansion is already enabled, so this adds no zone access.
-- Classes and deities match Humans. Each class/deity starts where a Human of it starts in Freeport; deities a
-- Human starts elsewhere use the class's usual Freeport spot, and Rangers and Druids (no Human Freeport start)
-- use West Freeport's safe point with the West Freeport bind. Stats: Drakkin base (world/client.cpp BaseRace) plus
-- the class bonus, with the Human default point spend.
-- Items a Human can use become usable by Drakkin too (race bit 32768).
-- World reads creation data at startup and items load through shared memory: restart the whole server.
DELETE FROM char_create_combinations WHERE race = 522;
DELETE FROM start_zones WHERE player_race = 522;
DELETE FROM char_create_point_allocations WHERE id BETWEEN 109 AND 121;

